--- !u!114 &3392020654258196130
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6598587887551514636}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ea762792cf3f240c18ec9f161da14d87, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  mapPointer: {fileID: 8956922853974653929}
  id: mythic_interactive_51.5138_-0.0232
  latitude: 0
  longitude: 0
  userId: 
  username: mythic_interactive
  title: Haunted Echoes
  content: "\rOn a moonless night at Russia Dock, the abandoned warehouses and rusted
    cranes became a stage for unspeakable horrors. \nAlex, a daring urban explorer,
    had heard whispers of restless souls and set out to uncover the truth.The air
    was unnaturally still as he stepped onto creaking planks that groaned under each
    careful step. \nA dense fog clung to the water, swallowing the dock in a shroud
    of darkness. In the distance, a mournful echo\u2014like the lament of lost souls\u2014seemed
    to drift over the tide. Drawn to an old boathouse, Alex discovered remnants of
    a past filled with sorrow: faded photographs, scattered tools, and a heavy sense
    of despair that pulsed like a heartbeat.\r\rThen, without warning, the silence
    shattered. Footsteps\u2014heavy, deliberate\u2014approached from behind, though
    no one was visible. \nThe temperature plummeted as a spectral figure emerged:
    a dockworker, his eyes hollow and voice a mere whisper of anguish, beckoning
    for escape from an eternal prison of regret.\r\rTrapped between terror and fascination,
    Alex realized that Russia Dock was more than decaying structures\u2014it was
    a tomb of memories, haunted by those doomed to linger in perpetual twilight.\nAs
    the ghost reached out, the chill of the night became a binding darkness, ensuring
    that some secrets were meant to remain buried in the deep, haunted echoes of
    the dock."
  theme: default
  track: default
  font: default
  likes: 0
  views: 0
  created: 0
  expire: 0
  photoUrl: 
